    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald O' Donovan are delighted to present leadon to the market. A rare opportunity to acquire a substantial detached split-level bungalow extending to over 2,750 sq. ft., ideally positioned within walking distance of Mallow town centre and offering exceptional versatility and potential.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a large sitting room, living room, kitchen, eight spacious double bedrooms, five of which are en-suite with a further main bathroom. The property is well maintained throughout and offers generous living and bedroom accommodation that could easily be adapted to suit a variety of needs.\n\nIts impressive size and layout would make it an exceptional family home, offering ample space for a family, multigenerational living or those requiring generous home-working or leisure areas.Previously operated as a B&B, the property presents significant potential to once again operate a guest accommodation business. \n\nThe property boasts a private, south-facing rear garden which enjoys a wonderful sense of privacy. The garden also benefits from stunning surrounding countryside views, providing a peaceful setting despite the property's incredibly convenient town location.\n\nThe location is undoubtedly one of the property's greatest assets. It is within walking distance of Mallow town centre, directly across from Mallow Railway Station and adjacent to the ever-popular Riverbank Walk. The Riverbank Walk provides a scenic route towards Mallow Town Park and the historic Mallow Castle, making this an ideal location for those who enjoy walking and the outdoors while still having all town amenities on the doorstep.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a tarmacadam driveway, ample parking and a large detached garage. The garage offers potential for a home office, studio or gym.\n\nThe property may also qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to meeting the relevant eligibility criteria. This could provide an exciting opportunity for the new owner to modernise and upgrade the property while putting their own stamp on this substantial home.\n\nA viewing comes highly recommended with sole selling agents Sherry FitzGerald O Donovan."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 10.30m x 4.76m\nCarpet. Cloakroom.\n\nSitting Room - 4.66m x 8.46m\nCarpet. Cornicing to ceiling. Solid Fuel Fire with marble surround. Feature Bay window.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.00m x 3.90m\nLaminate Flooring. Fitted Robes.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.14m x 1.39m\nFully Tiled. WHb, Toilet and Electric Shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.65m x 2.97m\nLaminate Flooring. Fitted Robes.\n\nBathroom - 2.45m x 2.10m\nFully Tiled. Bath, Whb, Toilet and Shower.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.10m x 3.44m\nCarpet. Fitted Robes.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.01m x 5.00m\nCarpet. Fitted Robes.\n\nBedroom 5 - 3.34m x 4.61m\nCarpet.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.35m x 0.75m\nLino Flooring, Whb, Toilet and Electric shower.\n\nBedroom 6 - 3.30m x 5.57m\nCarpet.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.40m x 0.83m\nLino Flooring. Whb, Toilet and Shower.\n\nBedroom 7 - 3.40m x 5.21m\nCarpet.\n\nEn-Suite - 0.81m x 2.88m\nLino Flooring. Whb, Toilet and Shower.\n\nBedroom 8 - 3.33m x 6.50m\nCarpet.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.41m x 0.90m\nLino Flooring, Whb, Toilet and Shower.\n\nLiving Room - 3.66m x 4.90m\nLaminate Flooring. Feature fireplace with solid stove insert.\n\nKitchen - 3.66m x 4.30m\nLino Flooring. Fully Fitted kitchen. Door to rear.\n\n"
      },
